---

# Security Statement

The Secure Container Supply Chain Security Platform is designed as a fully self-hosted security platform where all sensitive information is encrypted at rest and in transit, secrets are isolated from application code, authentication is protected using modern cryptographic standards, and infrastructure follows defense-in-depth principles.

